@page "/webhooks"

<PageTitle>Webhooks | PayChangu.NET Sample</PageTitle>

<RadzenStack Gap="1rem">
    <div>
        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.H4" TagName="TagName.H1">Webhooks</RadzenText>
        <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body1">
            Receive PayChangu transaction notifications and validate their signatures before processing them.
        </RadzenText>
    </div>

    <RadzenAlert AlertStyle="AlertStyle.Info">
        This sample exposes a server-side webhook endpoint. It validates the raw request body using the configured
        webhook secret, parses the event, and writes the event details to the application log.
    </RadzenAlert>

    <RadzenCard>
        <RadzenStack Gap="0.75rem">
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.H6">Webhook endpoint</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Subtitle2">HTTP method</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body1">POST</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Subtitle2">Path</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body1">/api/webhooks/paychangu</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Subtitle2">Signature header</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body1">Signature</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Subtitle2">Response</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body1">
                HTTP 200 when the signature and payload are valid; HTTP 401 for an invalid signature;
                HTTP 400 for an invalid signed payload.
            </RadzenText>
        </RadzenStack>
    </RadzenCard>

    <RadzenCard>
        <RadzenStack Gap="0.75rem">
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.H6">Events handled</RadzenText>
            <RadzenList>
                <RadzenListItem>Standard Checkout — checkout.payment</RadzenListItem>
                <RadzenListItem>Direct Charge — api.charge.payment</RadzenListItem>
                <RadzenListItem>Payout — api.payout</RadzenListItem>
            </RadzenList>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
                The parsed event exposes its payment flow, payment method, transaction identifier, and status.
                The sample logs these details without logging the raw payload or signature.
            </RadzenText>
        </RadzenStack>
    </RadzenCard>

    <RadzenCard>
        <RadzenStack Gap="0.75rem">
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.H6">Local testing</RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body1">
                PayChangu must be able to reach your webhook URL. When running locally, expose the application
                through a secure public tunnel and use the resulting public URL with the endpoint path above.
            </RadzenText>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
                Configure the webhook secret using .NET User Secrets:
            </RadzenText>
            <pre><code>dotnet user-secrets set "PayChangu:WebhookSecret" "&lt;your-webhook-secret&gt;"</code></pre>
            <RadzenText TextStyle="TextStyle.Body2">
                The endpoint returns HTTP 503 until a webhook secret is configured.
            </RadzenText>
        </RadzenStack>
    </RadzenCard>
</RadzenStack>
